{"id":"vod_zy360_67550","vodId":"67550","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"夏目友人帐 第三季","name_cn":"夏目友人帐 第三季","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"国产动漫","remarks":"全13集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20241103-1/f82b64e4a25adb5ecd107f4e7c6ec504.jpg"},"summary":"现正在白泉社旗下的少女漫画杂志《LaLa》上刊载的《夏目友人帐》，于白泉社的《夏目友人帐》官网上突然更新了一个天大喜讯——在2月24号发售的《LaLa4月号》，《夏目友人帐》将会迎来一个重大发表!是TV动画第三期吗?这对于夏目的fans来说也是值得高兴的消息。《夏目友人帐》的故事主要是说男主角夏目贵志，继承了祖母夏目玲子拥有看到妖怪的力量，而且因为祖母年轻时曾夺取了不少妖怪的名字，并把名字都记在了《友人帐》上，使不少妖怪会来找夏目希望拿回自己的名字。每一集都会描述妖怪和妖怪，或妖怪和人类的故事，把各种交错的心灵，迭交的思念，还有人与妖怪的种种隔阂都描写出来，是一部既治愈温暖又带点哀伤的佳作。《夏目友人帐》曾两度TV动画化，所以对于今次的重大发表，当然是期待第三季的来临了！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-11-03 21:06:42","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第01话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/Un9fRb7h/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/2n2kTAvC/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/TilRKVZ0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/biMyiIpQ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/bxpL2iWv/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/QqIf4Xci/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/LkMWYSwS/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/nIAbzuxs/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/ccM61vY6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/nTvFl0lm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/qEso9SXy/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/4zYkITxW/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/Ak7K5MqF/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:42:51.250Z"}